    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is Fluff's Adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/3a9ee883e697a3c30f9bac9dc41685af.poster.avif?t=1754122748\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/3a9ee883e697a3c30f9bac9dc41685af.webm?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/3a9ee883e697a3c30f9bac9dc41685af.mp4?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover an idyllic world through the eyes of colorful furbballs called Fluffs in this third-person puzzle platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an island full of secrets and collectibles for you to find. Learn to overcome challenges - both through dexterity while platforming in Fluff's oversized shoes and by solving numerous puzzles that will prevent you from progressing. But be warned: an evil force is invading Fluff's world and threatens to destroy the idyll forever ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore large-scale levels:</strong> Fluff's Adventure takes place in levels that you can explore at will. The aim is to reach the end of a level, but of course there are numerous secrets that you can find along the way.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/25f1bebdbfb3d8e171be12c7855b6822.poster.avif?t=1754122748\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/25f1bebdbfb3d8e171be12c7855b6822.webm?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/25f1bebdbfb3d8e171be12c7855b6822.mp4?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Solve color-based puzzles:</strong> Fluff's colors aren't just for show: After finding other Fluffs, you can freely switch between them to solve puzzles. Many puzzle elements in the game are colored, so you can only interact with them with a Fluff of the same color or with other objects of the same color.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/2cefd13c5403c7fbb86d9363bbeef815.poster.avif?t=1754122748\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/2cefd13c5403c7fbb86d9363bbeef815.webm?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/2cefd13c5403c7fbb86d9363bbeef815.mp4?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Immerse yourself in a relaxed and undirected game atmosphere:</strong> Fluff's Adventure won't annoy you with explanatory text or long drawn-out tutorials: you can explore the world at your own pace and solve puzzles without being pulled out of the game environment by texts or hints. Puzzles will also never put you under time pressure: Pure relaxation (as long as you don't get frustrated by solving puzzles)!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/a89150a49cc8e0f87587b07cc0f9694b.poster.avif?t=1754122748\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/a89150a49cc8e0f87587b07cc0f9694b.webm?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/a89150a49cc8e0f87587b07cc0f9694b.mp4?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Experience the adventures of Fluff in a gripping story</strong> Fluff's island is haunted by metallic creatures. Find out the reason for their arrival and stop them before it's too late ...<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/c98419ec5511f8981db9cad93c9fa7f7.poster.avif?t=1754122748\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/c98419ec5511f8981db9cad93c9fa7f7.webm?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/c98419ec5511f8981db9cad93c9fa7f7.mp4?t=1754122748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
